provenance), the Phase B calibration bench source, and the new B2 tools:
  c3_calibration_bench_v2.cpp  B2-6 redo (unique per-cell working sets
                               > LLC, per-repeat LLC scrub, fixed-seed
                               randomized cell order, 12 retained repeats,
                               per-VMA residency verification)
