                               (order statistics), loader-compatible table
  analyze_calibration_sensitivity.py  B2-7 endpoints + B2-8 dictionary
                               share/mapping sensitivity with the shared
                               strict-fit mapper re-implemented identically
  run_smoke_phase_b2.py        B2 smoke matrix + --create-stamp validator;
                               every run_config records runner/validator
                               SHA-256; single-client measured bundle
  collect_proofs_phase_b2.py   P1..P8 B2 proofs (set identity, tail columns,
                               measured path, calibration, stamps, determinism)
  finalize_phase_b2.py         PHASE_B2_VERDICT.json + PHASE_B2_FILES.sha256
  validate_run_bundle.py       copy of the phase_b2 pack validator (the one
                               --create-stamp stamps bind by SHA-256)
